#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-copy-sigs.md:14
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-copy-sigs.md:16
msgid "To copy signatures from a binary cache to the local store:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-copy-sigs.md:18
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix store copy-sigs --substituter https://cache.nixos.org \\\n"
"    --recursive /nix/store/q833p12cmm9qknyp1walqih941msnb9z-hello-2.12.1\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-copy-sigs.md:23
msgid "To copy signatures from one binary cache to another:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-copy-sigs.md:25
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix store copy-sigs --substituter https://cache.nixos.org \\\n"
"    --store file:///tmp/binary-cache \\\n"
"    --recursive -v \\\n"
"    /nix/store/q833p12cmm9qknyp1walqih941msnb9z-hello-2.12.1\n"
"imported 2 signatures\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-copy-sigs.md:33
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-copy-sigs.md:35
msgid ""
"`nix store copy-sigs` copies store path signatures from one store to another."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-copy-sigs.md:37
msgid ""
"It is not advised to copy signatures to binary cache stores. Binary cache "
"signatures are stored in `.narinfo` files. Since these are cached "
"aggressively, clients may not see the new signatures quickly. It is "
"therefore better to set any required signatures when the paths are first "
"uploaded to the binary cache."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-copy-sigs.md:39
msgid ""
"Store paths are processed in parallel. The amount of parallelism is "
"controlled by the [`http-connections`](../../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-"
"http-connections) settings."
msgstr ""

